{"4519600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scrap Battalion", "steam_appid": 4519600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a mercenary battalion from scrap—and fight your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scrap Battalion</i> is a strategy autobattler focused on drafting units, building powerful synergies, and unleashing massive, chaotic battles. Assemble a wild army of fighters, support units, siege weapons, and experimental tech—then watch your battalion tear through the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/4b149f21992667d20b978ff151c1daa0.poster.avif?t=1785507398\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/4b149f21992667d20b978ff151c1daa0.webm?t=1785507398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/4b149f21992667d20b978ff151c1daa0.mp4?t=1785507398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a test of strategy, creativity, and adaptation. The right combination can turn a ragtag squad into an unstoppable war machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/648ff40953efc5e2e18fb29516eccf1c.poster.avif?t=1785507398\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/648ff40953efc5e2e18fb29516eccf1c.webm?t=1785507398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/648ff40953efc5e2e18fb29516eccf1c.mp4?t=1785507398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RECRUIT &amp; COMMAND: Recruit from 60+ unique units, each with their own weapon, role, and perk. Build your battalion with precision—or embrace the chaos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAN &amp; ADAPT: Study the battlefield and adjust between rounds. Manage limited resources, refine your strategy, and craft powerful army compositions to overcome increasingly deadly threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNLEASH FUSION UNITS: Combine specific units to create powerful fusion units with unique abilities. Turn your army into something truly monstrous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EQUIP &amp; STACK ITEMS: Deploy 70+ items to enhance your units. Stack, merge, and optimize effects to push your builds to the limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/99df288df5fd4044c137c91c243bfc30.poster.avif?t=1785507398\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/99df288df5fd4044c137c91c243bfc30.webm?t=1785507398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519600/extras/99df288df5fd4044c137c91c243bfc30.mp4?t=1785507398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MASSIVE BATTLES: Watch your strategies come to life in large-scale, over-the-top combat where positioning, timing, and synergy decide everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RISE THROUGH THE RANKS: Survive 18 escalating rounds of enemies. Take on optional challenges for greater rewards—but greater risk. Can your battalion withstand the final waves?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a m